# CODEOWNERS

# PLACEHOLDER FILE. Every owner handle below is a placeholder.
#
# The maintainer of record replaces each `@PLACEHOLDER-...` handle with a real
# GitHub user or team before this file is merged. A placeholder handle matches
# nobody and grants no access, so an unreplaced file falls back to the
# repository default rather than to a wrong person.
#
# Order matters: the first matching pattern wins, so the default rule comes
# first and the specific rules below refine it.

# Default owners: everything that no later rule claims.
